# --- data ---
# Downloads and everything derived from them: gigabytes, and mostly redistributable
# only under their own licences. Commit the commands in docs/datasets.md, never the
# data. The two READMEs are the exception.
data/downloads/*
!data/downloads/.gitkeep
!data/downloads/README.md
data/trajectories/*
!data/trajectories/.gitkeep
data/simplified-trajectories/
data/synthetic/
data/renders/

